1. a table of users
alice, right password  -> connected
alice, wrong password  -> bad user name or password
nobody                 -> not authorized
unknown user           -> bad user name or password

2. a hook instead of the table
token t0ken            -> connected
token other            -> bad user name or password

3. the ACL
reader subscribes to public/news: 1
reader subscribes to private/x:   128 (128 = refused)
writer subscribes to public/#:    1
reader publishes: acknowledged 1, delivered 0
writer publishes: delivered "from writer"
